      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 영문을 모르겠다니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020C601BB38C7440020BAA8B974ACA0B2E4B2C8AE4CC694002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 쥬피썬더가\n성격이 너무 성급한 거 있죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020C96CD53CC36CB354AC00000AC131ACA9C7740020B108BB340020C131AE09D55C0020AC700020C788C8E0002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금도 승부를 할 것 같으니까\n곧장 배틀코트로 뛰어간 거예요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08B3C40020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5600020AC830020AC19C73CB2C8AE4C000AACE7C7A50020BC30D2C0CF54D2B8B85C0020B6F0C5B4AC040020AC70C608C694002E002E002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드릴게요!\n저와 포켓몬 승부를 해 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n배틀코트에서 기다리고 있을게요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940021000AC800C6400020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5740020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100001BE00000ABC30D2C0CF54D2B8C5D0C11C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C744AC8CC694002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저희와 승부해 주실 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
