      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬은 성격에 따라\n스피드가 빨라지기도 하거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7400020C131ACA9C5D00020B530B77C000AC2A4D53CB4DCAC000020BE68B77CC9C0AE30B3C40020D558AC70B4E0C694002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "성급한 성격은 물론이고,\n겁쟁이나 명랑, 천진난만도 그렇다고 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C131AE09D55C0020C131ACA9C7400020BB3CB860C774ACE0002C000AAC81C7C1C774B0980020BA85B791002C0020CC9CC9C4B09CB9CCB3C40020ADF8B807B2E4ACE00020D574C694002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 스피드가 빠르면 빠를수록\n기술을 빠르게 사용할 수 있죠.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE00020C2A4D53CB4DCAC000020BE60B974BA740020BE60B97CC218B85D000AAE30C220C7440020BE60B974AC8C0020C0ACC6A9D5600020C2180020C788C8E0002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단, 아무리 빠른 포켓몬이라도 같은 기술을\n다시 사용하는 데는 3초가 걸린대요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E8002C0020C544BB34B9AC0020BE60B9780020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CB3C40020AC19C7400020AE30C220C744000AB2E4C2DC0020C0ACC6A9D558B2940020B370B29400200033CD08AC000020AC78B9B0B300C694002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 또...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE00020B610002E002E002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "샤!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야! 나만 내버려두고\n포켓몬센터로 가면 안 되지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57C00210020B098B9CC0020B0B4BC84B824B450ACE0000AD3ECCF13BAACC13CD130B85C0020AC00BA740020C5480020B418C9C0002100100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 이만 가 볼게요!\n승부해 줘서 고마워요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
